Distribution changes: the published Tesseract.js-core asm.js engine is enclosed
in a private JavaScript scope but otherwise preserved byte-for-byte; the English
model is gzip-compressed and base64-embedded without changing its contents.
The fflate synchronous decompressor is bundled and minified. The original
receipt parser and image wrapper provide a new public API around those components.

